---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  lang="en"
  title="Legal notice — Fabio Steyer"
  description="Legal notice."
  altHref="/impressum"
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Legal notice</h1>

  <div class="beleg-fehlt mt-6">
    <strong>DECISION PENDING.</strong> The content of this page has not been settled.
    This page must not be published while this notice is here.
  </div>

  <section class="doc-section" aria-labelledby="criterion">
    <h2 id="criterion" class="doc-section__label">The governing criterion</h2>
    <div class="doc-section__body">
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Under German law, § 5(1) DDG ties the disclosure duty to digital services offered on a
        commercial basis and normally for payment. Whether a job-application site with no payment,
        no offering and no advertising falls under it is a legal question that is not settled here.
        The site is publicly reachable via GitHub Pages, not only by the recipients it is sent to.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-muted)">
        The German version of this page is authoritative.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
